      ('starter-costco-hot-dog-combo', 'easy', 'everyday-products', 'How much is the hot dog and drink combo at a Costco food court?', 'The quarter-pound hot dog with a 20 oz soda (or bottled water), U.S. food courts, 2026.', '/items/hot-dog-combo.svg', 'Illustration of a hot dog with mustard next to a red soda cup', 1.50, 'U.S. food court menu price', '2026-04-29', 'Costco''s hot dog and soda combo has cost $1.50 for about 40 years. In 2026 Costco added bottled water as an option at the same price.', 'Costco''s iconic $1.50 hot dog combo debuts new change for the first time in decades', 'WDBJ7 (Gray News)', 'https://www.wdbj7.com/2026/04/29/costcos-iconic-150-hot-dog-combo-debuts-new-change-first-time-decades/', 'The combo will still cost $1.50 whether you choose a 20-ounce soda or a bottle of water.', ''),
